+   instrument and decides whether the Nicla Sense ME and the RM3100s are on separate buses
+   (the D-73 separation rule) as the flight does: only instruments whose latest report is
+   an acquisition count, and an instrument the newest HK reports MISSING (sensor_health)
+   does not. A reboot re-reports every instrument it finds (before its BOOT EVR), so the
+   latest report per instrument is current; an instrument absent after a reboot keeps its
